Incorporation of functional groups with Lewis basic nitrogen sites, including pyridine, pyridazine and pyrimidine groups into NOTT101 can remarkably improve both the total volumetric methane storage (at 65 bar and room temperature) and working capacities, which may provide a promising strategy to target new MOF materials with even higher methane storage and working capacities.
